<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>SupplyChain Sentinel — Pharma Alert Cards</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f8fafc;
    --card-bg: #ffffff;
    --border: #e2e8f0;
    --text: #0f172a;
    --muted: #64748b;
    --high: #dc2626;
    --high-bg: #fef2f2;
    --medium: #d97706;
    --medium-bg: #fffbeb;
    --low: #16a34a;
    --low-bg: #f0fdf4;
    --accent: #2563eb;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #1e293b);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 32px 24px;
  }
  header h1 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 26px; }
  header p { margin: 0; color: #cbd5e1; max-width: 780px; }
  .stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .stat { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 16px; min-width: 120px; }
  .stat .n { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; }
  .stat .l { font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }

  main { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px 80px; }
  section { margin-bottom: 40px; }
  h2 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .diagram-wrap {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .diagram-wrap svg { display: block; min-width: 900px; }

  .card {
    background: var(--card-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left-width: 5px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .card.high { border-left-color: var(--high); }
  .card.medium { border-left-color: var(--medium); }
  .card.low { border-left-color: var(--low); }

  .card-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; }
  .card-head h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; flex: 1; }
  .badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .badge.high { background: var(--high-bg); color: var(--high); }
  .badge.medium { background: var(--medium-bg); color: var(--medium); }
  .badge.low { background: var(--low-bg); color: var(--low); }

  .card p.explanation { color: #334155; margin: 12px 0; font-size: 14px; }

  .sources { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .sources a {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    background: #eff6ff;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
  }
  .sources a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .approve {
    margin-top: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border);
    padding-top: 12px;
  }
  .approve input { width: 16px; height: 16px; }

  .empty { color: var(--muted); font-style: italic; }

  footer {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 24px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  footer a { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>SupplyChain Sentinel</h1>
  <p>Pharma trade &amp; tariff causality — cited, explainable Alert Cards connecting policy/news events to SEC filing disclosures via a shared entity graph.</p>
  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat"><div class="n">{{ stats.policy_events }}</div><div class="l">Policy Events</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="n">{{ stats.filing_mentions }}</div><div class="l">Filing Mentions</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="n">{{ stats.graph_links }}</div><div class="l">Graph Links</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="n">{{ stats.alert_cards }}</div><div class="l">Alert Cards</div></div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section>
    <h2>Dependency graph</h2>
    <div class="diagram-wrap">
      {% if dependency_svg %}
        {{ dependency_svg | safe }}
      {% else %}
        <p class="empty">No graph links to visualize yet — run src/graph.py.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Alert Cards</h2>
    {% if not cards %}
      <p class="empty">No alerts yet — run src/alerts.py.</p>
    {% endif %}
    {% for card in cards %}
      <div class="card {{ card.severity }}">
        <div class="card-head">
          <h3>{{ card.title }}</h3>
          <span class="badge {{ card.severity }}">{{ card.severity }}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="explanation">{{ card.explanation }}</p>
        <div class="sources">
          <a href="{{ card.policy_source_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Policy source: {{ card.policy_event.country }} — {{ card.policy_event.policy_type }}</a>
          <a href="{{ card.filing_source_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Filing source: {{ card.filing_mention.company }} {{ card.filing_mention.filing_type }}</a>
        </div>
        <label class="approve">
          <input type="checkbox" class="approve-checkbox" data-alert-id="{{ card.id }}">
          Reviewed by analyst (stored locally in this browser only — a stand-in for a full human-approval workflow; see README)
        </label>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  Built with a two-agent pipeline (Policy Agent + Filing Agent) + causal graph merge, coded with Claude Code.
  See <a href="../CHANGELOG.md">CHANGELOG.md</a> for the baseline-vs-advanced comparison and <a href="../REPRODUCTION.md">REPRODUCTION.md</a> to rerun from cached data.
</footer>

<script>
(function () {
  var boxes = document.querySelectorAll(".approve-checkbox");
  boxes.forEach(function (box) {
    var key = "scs-approved-" + box.dataset.alertId;
    try {
      box.checked = localStorage.getItem(key) === "1";
    } catch (e) {}
    box.addEventListener("change", function () {
      try {
        localStorage.setItem(key, box.checked ? "1" : "0");
      } catch (e) {}
    });
  });
})();
</script>

</body>
</html>
